caption: FRONT-BY-FRONT SOLUTION TYPES
campaign-component: front-by-front-solution-types

LOCKED: The fronts should not all be solved by killing enemies.

Waaagh: military defeat, psychic disruption, and eventual closure.

Scorge: defeat an organized undead offensive and break its necromantic command infrastructure.

Bugworld: dismantle a distributed psionic colony before it becomes self-sustaining.

ADhN: establish trust and negotiate a controlled withdrawal, border, or joint defense arrangement.

Yao: resolve a refugee-colonial invasion through diplomacy, political division, force, or some combination.

Haneda Bloom: contain, communicate with, redirect, prune, poison, or sever an invasive supernatural ecosystem.

Brood Passage: repel, redirect, relocate, or manage a kaiju migration and nesting event.
